{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072480/extras/Description_Logo_en.png?t=1742974869\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072480/extras/foodrow1.png?t=1742974869\" />Play as Buffet Knight, a tiny hero with a big appetite in this hungry action adventure. Disaster strikes as the Demon Chef steals all the food from Gourmet Kingdom, and it is up to you to save the culinary world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore a diverse and colourful world spanning from the lush vegetable forests to the lofty cotton candy clouds. Delve into puzzling dungeons, battle monsters, find treasures and discover secrets! Gobble up everything around you, but will your appetite be satisfied as the connoisseur of all that is delicious?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Thanks for the Meal!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Swallow food, objects, and even your fallen foes to fuel your attacks!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072480/extras/CroppedGif_1.gif?t=1742974869\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Earn New Abilities!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Discover skills to aid in both combat and exploration!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072480/extras/CroppedGif_2.gif?t=1742974869\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Evolve and Grow Stronger!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Choose attributes to upgrade, find unique accessories to augment your abilities!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072480/extras/Screenshot_Upgrade_english.png?t=1742974869\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A delicious single player action adventure with charming pixel art and a catchy soundtrack.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> A colourful, interconnected food-themed world to explore full of treasures and secrets to find.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Challenge monster and puzzle-laden dungeons, and battle mighty bosses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Evolve and become stronger! Learn new abilities, level up your attributes, equip accessories.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Multiple endings to discover!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072480/extras/foodrow2.png?t=1742974869\" /></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Imperfectly Content Hero","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3072480/7b725eb7d02449677bd7e302d2331ce46cca76e8.jpg"},{"name":"Insatiable Black Hole","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3072480/b4d06eb5ad5c677103b86b018e46a86f74edd660.jpg"},{"name":"More Than You Can Chew","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3072480/f8e405531f720a0ce6b04b7d435fce50a09285c9.jpg"},{"name":"Tough Cookie Champion","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3072480/b5f08e6bf0e7b7f168bc47bb073799ae0034b0b8.jpg"},{"name":"True Gourmand","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3072480/3b1f783c2ade3f10d49519c603ab5942b1db7608.jpg"},{"name":"Food Hunter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3072480/46c9acf4d552c720172b38058ac3d4d7c53073c3.jpg"},{"name":"Bistrokaiser Fan","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3072480/39497e187ae7f82195c8cd22a4705b34eba31324.jpg"},{"name":"Pay Your Dues!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.co