mg\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072480/extras/CroppedGif_2.gif?t=1742974869\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Evolve and Grow Stronger!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Choose attributes to upgrade, find unique accessories to augment your abilities!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072480/extras/Screenshot_Upgrade_english.png?t=1742974869\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A delicious single player action adventure with charming pixel art and a catchy soundtrack.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> A colourful, interconnected food-themed world to explore full of treasures and secrets to find.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Challenge monster and puzzle-laden dungeons, and battle mighty bosses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Evolve and become stronger! Learn new abilities, level up your attributes, equip accessories.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Multiple endings to discover!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072480/extras/foodrow2.png?t=1742974869\" /></p>","developers":["Nowis-337 Games"],"dlc":[3465150],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072480/header.jpg?t=1742974869","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recomm